{title: Yamma Yamma}
{artist: Mohammed Rafi R D Burman}
{key: B}

{c: Verse 1}
[B] [Em] [B],        Yamma yamma yamma yamma
[Em] [B],        Yeh khubsurat sama
[G] [B],        Bas aaj ki raat hai zindagi
[B],        Kal hum kahan tum kahan
[B],        Kab kya hojae kisko khaber
[Em] [B],        Aa nachle jhumkar
[B],        Yeh zindagi ek lamba safar
[Em] [B],        Pal bhar ke sab hum safar
[G] [B],        Ek raat ke mehmaan sab Yahan
[B],        kal hum kahan tum kahan
[B],        Haste huwe aisi shaan
[Em] [B],        Se deewane jal jaenge
[B],        Are jalti shama se milke
[Em] [B],        Gale parwane jal jaenge
[G] [B],        Reh jayga yado ka diyaa
[B],        Kal hum kahan tum kahan
